<title>PAKISTAN: SQUASH-WORLD OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WORLD OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the men's</p>
<p>World Open squash championship on Tuesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):4-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Ahmed Barada (Egypt)</p>
<p>12-15 15-2 9-15 15-9 15-13Craig Roland (Australia) beat 6-Del</p>
<p>Harris (England) 15-14 15-13 15-75-Chris Walker (England) beat</p>
<p>Zarak Jahan (Pakistan) 15-6 15-12 15-11Zubair Jahan (Pakistan)</p>
<p>beat Anthony Hill (Australia) 15-8 10-15 15-4 13-15 15-12</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Jonathon Power (Canada) 15-13</p>
<p>15-13 15-4</p>
<p> 7-Simon Parke (England) beat Julien Bonetat (France)   15-12</p>
<p>12-15 15-10 17-16</p>
<p>3-Brett Martin (Australia) beat Simon Frenz (Germany)  15-12</p>
<p>15-9 15-13</p>
<p> 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Mark Cairns (England)   10-15</p>
<p>15-11 15-10 15-8.</p>
